| Sports Car          | 6304  | 52     |
| Crossover           | 3255  | 25     |
| Diesel Truck        | 1923  | 15     |
| Compact SUV         | 4103  | 54     |
| Luxury SUV          | 4429  | 57     |
| Cargo Van           | 2663  | 18     |
| Pickup Truck        | 1691  | 69     |
| Roadster            | 5632  | 26     |
| Muscle Car          | 4793  | 38     |
